#: 243e279f6ee64935b6bf239f1f9d3634
msgid "Companion Computers"
msgstr "伴飞计算机"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computers.rst:7
#: 10494011c4cd414e98741cc0aeeb874f
msgid ""
"Companion Computers can be used to interface and communicate with ArduPilot "
"on a flight controller using the MAVLink protocol.  By doing this your "
"companion computer gets all the MAVLink data produced by the autopilot "
"(including GPS data) and can use it to make intelligent decisions during "
"flight. For example, \"take a photo when the vehicle is at these GPS co-"
"ordinates\", gather and pre-process information from advanced sensors or "
"actuate lights, auxiliary servos or any other interfaces."
msgstr ""
"伴飞计算机可通过 MAVLink 协议与飞控上的 ArduPilot 进行接口和通信。通过这种方式，伴飞计算机可获取自动驾驶仪产生的所有 MAVLink"
" 数据（包括 GPS 数据），并利用这些数据在飞行中做出智能决策。例如，「当飞行器到达某 GPS "
"坐标时拍照」、收集和预处理高级传感器信息，或驱动灯光、辅助舵机或其他接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computers.rst:15
#: 690a4c00d9bd4be49ed3b2537d9ecc33
msgid ""
"There are two major parts to Companion Computers - hardware and software."
msgstr "伴飞计算机由两大部分组成：硬件和软件。"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computers.rst:17
#: feb0409062e143079b0ec853c347250f
msgid ""
"The Companion Computer hardware refers to the specific computer hardware "
"being used. This is typically a small ARM-based Single Board Computer. "
"Specific tutorials for popular Companion Computer hardware are listed below."
msgstr "伴飞计算机硬件指所使用的具体计算机硬件，通常是基于 ARM 架构的小型单板计算机。以下列出了常见伴飞计算机硬件的具体教程。"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computers.rst:40
#: db35d2ead33a47279b36e47026529590
msgid ""
"The Companion Computer software refers to the programs and tools that run on"
" the Companion Computer. They will take in MAVLink telemetry from the Flight"
" Controller and can route and process the telemetry data. Specific tutorials"
" for popular Companion Computer software tools/suites are listed below."
msgstr ""
"伴飞计算机软件指在伴飞计算机上运行的程序和工具。这些软件从飞控接收 MAVLink "
"遥测数据，并可对其进行路由和处理。以下列出了常见伴飞计算机软件工具/套件的具体教程。"

